1
00:00:23,776 --> 00:00:28,515
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:32,227
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,451 --> 00:00:34,696
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,043 --> 00:00:37,750
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,629 --> 00:00:43,157
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:46,789
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:50,755
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,899 --> 00:00:55,395
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,395 --> 00:01:00,035
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:02,083
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:08,035
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,227 --> 00:01:11,915
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,915 --> 00:01:15,486
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,651 --> 00:01:22,595
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,043 --> 00:01:26,664
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,664 --> 00:01:30,348
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,435 --> 00:01:35,363
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,363 --> 00:01:39,523
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:46,819
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,552 --> 00:01:50,019
=Episode 7=

21
00:01:52,079 --> 00:01:52,879
Governor,

22
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,760
he was right there in the cabinet.

23
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,560
Why did you...

24
00:01:57,519 --> 00:02:02,599
On the wedding day, the moment we get
the phoenix crown, Xu You'an is dead.

25
00:02:05,239 --> 00:02:08,879
In that case, we might as well
squeeze his last bit of value.

26
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:11,479
By sending Rong Xiaonan to his side

27
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:16,159
to help find the Buddha Head for me,
he'd die meaningfully.

28
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:19,560
What if Rong Xiaonan refuses?

29
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:24,000
With the ruse, he won't say no.

30
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:51,520
Mr. Rong,

31
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:57,080
from now on,
we're all in the same leaky boat.

32
00:02:58,319 --> 00:03:01,520
If we want revenge,
we must first stay alive.

33
00:03:04,864 --> 00:03:07,808
♪There are always too many♪

34
00:03:07,808 --> 00:03:09,792
♪Helpless situations♪

35
00:03:09,792 --> 00:03:12,383
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

36
00:03:13,496 --> 00:03:15,392
♪Even if I have questions♪

37
00:03:16,719 --> 00:03:18,560
If you wish to find the Buddha Head,

38
00:03:19,439 --> 00:03:23,199
take me to find the fake Jade Buddha Head,
and we'll get the clues.

39
00:03:25,152 --> 00:03:27,876
♪Wandering around♪

40
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,853
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

41
00:03:30,853 --> 00:03:35,314
♪Go through the entanglement♪

42
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,536
♪If longing♪

43
00:03:37,536 --> 00:03:40,567
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

44
00:03:40,567 --> 00:03:43,322
♪How can I be at ease♪

45
00:03:43,424 --> 00:03:45,738
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

46
00:03:45,856 --> 00:03:47,712
♪And travelled around the world♪

47
00:03:47,808 --> 00:03:50,896
♪Scars all over me♪

48
00:03:51,168 --> 00:03:54,080
♪If longing never fades♪

49
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,529
♪Burns still hot♪

50
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:27,872
♪The music halts, the song falls still♪

51
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:41,952
♪Wine cups go around amid laughter♪

52
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:47,560
(The voice of the man on stage
was exactly the same as my master's.)

53
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,160
(My master hasn't been
on stage for years.)

54
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,959
(And who was that woman?)

55
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:55,399
(She wore the kingfisher phoenix crown.)

56
00:04:56,399 --> 00:04:58,560
(That is the opera world's
long-lost treasure.)

57
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,240
Hey.

58
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,496
The kingfisher phoenix crown.

59
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:07,160
My master and a dan actress in that crown
were singing "The Palace of Eternal Life".

60
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,879
I asked you to find the Buddha Head,
not some phoenix crown.

61
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:14,920
How dare you fool me?

62
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,920
Touch it.

63
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:28,519
If you don't get clues of Buddha Head,
you will go back to prison to rot.

64
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:40,560
A treasure of the opera world
and a treasure of Fengcheng.

65
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:45,399
The kingfisher phoenix crown
is connected to the Jade Buddha Head.

66
00:05:46,079 --> 00:05:49,480
(Can someone truly sense
a thing's hidden truth through touch?)

67
00:05:51,079 --> 00:05:54,800
If they are truly connected,
I'll find the kingfisher phoenix crown.

68
00:05:55,160 --> 00:06:01,360
If the Buddha Head cannot be found
by then, you're done for.

69
00:06:06,079 --> 00:06:06,879
Who is it?

70
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:11,199
Food is ready.

71
00:06:11,199 --> 00:06:12,360
Enjoy your meal, gentlemen.

72
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:16,720
Sir,

73
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,319
here are your banknotes

74
00:06:18,319 --> 00:06:19,360
and your train tickets.

75
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,160
Take them.

76
00:06:28,544 --> 00:06:29,884
(Collect one hundred with this banknote)

77
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:45,040
The biggest figure
in Fengcheng is really generous,

78
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:47,000
offering a 100 gold bounty
on Xu You'an's life.

79
00:06:47,079 --> 00:06:49,160
I really want to kill him now
and take the reward.

80
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:50,519
What's the rush?

81
00:06:50,688 --> 00:06:52,269
There's a condition attached.

82
00:06:52,544 --> 00:06:54,959
We can't make the move
until after his wedding.

83
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,160
Do you all understand?

84
00:07:00,839 --> 00:07:01,639
Let me go!

85
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,759
Come here!

86
00:07:08,519 --> 00:07:09,519
Who sent you?

87
00:07:15,328 --> 00:07:16,480
As expected,

88
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:18,839
my foster father cares for me so much.

89
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,800
Don't kill me! Don't kill me!

90
00:07:27,759 --> 00:07:28,800
Murder!

91
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:33,240
Murder!

92
00:07:51,104 --> 00:07:52,360
(Zhuzi, Young Rong Xiaonan)

93
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,839
Shitou.

94
00:07:55,936 --> 00:07:57,440
(Shitou, Young Xu You'an)

95
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,480
What was your original name?

96
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,240
I didn't have a name.

97
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:43,720
I only got a name
after my master adopted me.

98
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:47,399
Then how long have you been
in the Rongqing Troupe?

99
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:50,919
I've been adopted by my master
since I was a baby.

100
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:53,720
Young Marshal, there's no need
to pry into my story.

101
00:08:54,639 --> 00:08:57,399
Better use your time
to find the phoenix crown.

102
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:03,759
Let me go!

103
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:04,720
Miss Jiang?

104
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,679
Something's wrong.

105
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,080
Haha!

106
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,720
Let me go!

107
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:09,879
Let go!

108
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,720
Let me go!

109
00:09:35,039 --> 00:09:36,279
I just heard from them

110
00:09:36,639 --> 00:09:39,919
that Fengcheng's biggest figure
plans to kill you after your wedding.

111
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,879
I'm telling you,

112
00:09:42,879 --> 00:09:43,840
we are the Xiao...

113
00:09:52,879 --> 00:09:58,919
Mr. Rong, don't you know
she's my fiancee?

114
00:10:01,679 --> 00:10:03,000
Why are you wearing this again?

115
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,559
Running from the wedding again?

116
00:10:06,752 --> 00:10:08,480
♪If longing♪

117
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:11,639
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

118
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:14,394
♪How can I be at ease♪

119
00:10:14,496 --> 00:10:16,810
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

120
00:10:16,928 --> 00:10:18,784
♪And travelled around the world♪

121
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:21,968
♪Scars all over me♪

122
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:25,152
♪If longing never fades♪

123
00:10:25,152 --> 00:10:26,601
♪Burns still hot♪

124
00:10:26,601 --> 00:10:29,680
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

125
00:10:29,952 --> 00:10:31,520
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

126
00:10:50,944 --> 00:10:52,224
♪As if it were fate♪

127
00:10:52,224 --> 00:10:53,581
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

128
00:10:54,143 --> 00:10:57,380
♪We miss each other♪

129
00:10:58,624 --> 00:11:00,192
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

130
00:11:00,192 --> 00:11:02,592
♪And a bizarre♪

131
00:11:02,592 --> 00:11:05,394
♪Anonymous legend♪

132
00:11:05,924 --> 00:11:07,936
♪The plot twists and turns♪

133
00:11:08,084 --> 00:11:09,824
♪Play out over and over again♪

134
00:11:09,824 --> 00:11:12,888
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

135
00:11:13,248 --> 00:11:15,168
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

136
00:11:15,168 --> 00:11:16,160
♪Refuse to submit♪

137
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:19,360
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

138
00:11:21,024 --> 00:11:23,936
♪There are always too many♪

139
00:11:23,936 --> 00:11:25,824
♪Helpless situations♪

140
00:11:25,824 --> 00:11:28,448
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

141
00:11:29,579 --> 00:11:31,539
♪Even if I have questions♪

142
00:11:31,539 --> 00:11:33,539
♪I harbor desires♪

143
00:11:33,539 --> 00:11:36,416
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

144
00:11:36,767 --> 00:11:38,400
♪People come and go♪

145
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:41,216
♪I'm still all alone♪

146
00:11:41,216 --> 00:11:43,944
♪Wandering around♪

147
00:11:44,192 --> 00:11:47,045
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

148
00:11:47,045 --> 00:11:51,506
♪Go through the entanglement♪

149
00:11:51,872 --> 00:11:53,696
♪If longing♪

150
00:11:53,696 --> 00:11:56,759
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

151
00:11:56,759 --> 00:11:59,514
♪How can I be at ease♪

152
00:11:59,616 --> 00:12:01,930
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

153
00:12:02,048 --> 00:12:03,904
♪And travelled around the world♪

154
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:07,088
♪Scars all over me♪

155
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:10,272
♪If longing never fades♪

156
00:12:10,272 --> 00:12:11,721
♪Burns still hot♪

157
00:12:11,721 --> 00:12:14,800
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

158
00:12:15,072 --> 00:12:16,929
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

159
00:12:16,992 --> 00:12:18,176
♪In the next life♪

160
00:12:18,176 --> 00:12:22,656
♪Entangle with you again♪
